  "bodyHash": "30d803320fc6df1f",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/bundle.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Bundle. Made with love. Serilum's mods combined, for easier downloading!\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-bundle.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"About the bundle\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>客户端整合包</strong>是一种特殊的模组，它将Serilum的多个<strong>客户端类型</strong>模组整合为一个。虽然我很难将我的模组归类到一起，但我尝试这样做是为了让大家更容易安装。它使用了一种名为JiJ（Jar in Jar）的系统。这意味着包含的模组保持完全独立，但允许像整合包一样捆绑安装。所有模组仍拥有各自的配置文件，并且你会在游戏内的模组列表中看到它们。<br><br>该整合包是整合包开发的额外辅助工具，但并不取代我个人偏好的模块化模组系统。不过，你可以通过整合包的配置文件禁用包含的模组。<strong>更改配置后需要重启游戏才能生效。</strong><br><br>由于JiJ系统的工作方式，它与正常安装模组以及同时安装整合包中包含的模组兼容。这主要用于强制指定特定版本，但如果不小心以这种方式重复安装了同一个模组，也不会造成问题。虽然这可能不是问题，但最好只安装一次。因此，如果你决定安装此整合包，可以移除其中包含的其他模组。<br><br>我希望这个整合包对喜欢大型内容模组的你们有所帮助。感谢多年来大家的支持！<br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Dependencies\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"Requires Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg&w=440\" alt=\"Environment: Client\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Configurable\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"Configuration guide\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p><details><summary>显示剧透</summary><span><strong>enableAdvancementScreenshot</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableCurrentGameMusicTrack</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableFullBrightnessToggle</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableGlobalNarrationToggle</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableGUIClock</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableGUICompass</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableGUIFollowers</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableHideHands</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableImprovedSignEditing</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableOmegaMute</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enablePassiveShield</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enablePersistentInventorySearch</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableVanillaZoom</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span></details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/available-bundles.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Available Bundles\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;以下Serilum模组整合包可用：</p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-client-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Client Bundle</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-customization-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Customization Bundle</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-extra-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Extra Bundle</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-qol-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's QoL Bundle</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-rpg-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's RPG Bundle</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-spawn-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Spawn Bundle</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/mods-included.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Mods included\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/advancement-screenshot.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/advancement-screenshot\" target=\"_blank\">成就截图</a></td>\n<td>每当获得成就时自动截图。记录你的进度！</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/current-game-music-track.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/current-game-music-track\" target=\"_blank\">当前游戏音乐曲目</a></td>\n<td>通过GUI临时显示当前播放的歌曲标题。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr.\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/full-brightness-toggle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/full-brightness-toggle\" target=\"_blank\">全亮度切换</a></td>\n<td>按G键在游戏内切换亮度/伽马值至最大，获得全亮夜视效果。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/global-narration-toggle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/global-narration-toggle\" target=\"_blank\">全局旁白切换</a></td>\n<td>使旁白设置跨实例自动全局化。开启和关闭屏幕。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/gui-clock.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/gui-clock\" target=\"_blank\">GUI时钟</a></td>\n<td>在GUI/HUD中显示游玩的时间/天数，背包中有一个时钟。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/gui-compass.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/gui-compass\" target=\"_blank\">GUI指南针</a></td>\n<td>在GUI/HUD中显示方向和坐标，背包中有一个指南针。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/gui-followers.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/gui-followers\" target=\"_blank\">GUI跟随者</a></td>\n<td>在GUI/HUD中显示周围所有驯服且未坐下的跟随者列表。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/hide-hands.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hide-hands\" target=\"_blank\">隐藏双手</a></td>\n<td>在第一人称视角下隐藏副手和/或主手，可选择在手持特定物品（如火把、不死图腾或盾牌）时隐藏。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/improved-sign-editing.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/improved-sign-editing\" target=\"_blank\">改进的告示牌编辑</a></td>\n<td>更好的告示牌编辑功能。打字时按Shift切换到下一行或上一行。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/omega-mute.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/omega-mute\" target=\"_blank\">Omega静音</a></td>\n<td>你唯一需要的模组，用于完全控制游戏内的单个声音。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/passive-shield.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/passive-shield\" target=\"_blank\">被动护盾</a></td>\n<td>当在副手中空闲持有时，护盾会被隐藏并提供被动保护。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/persistent-inventory-search.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/persistent-inventory-search\" target=\"_blank\">持久的物品栏搜索</a></td>\n<td>使搜索查询在切换标签页和关闭界面时保留在创造模式物品栏中。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/vanilla-zoom.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/vanilla-zoom\" target=\"_blank\">原版缩放</a></td>\n<td>使用望远镜物品添加随时可用的缩放功能热键。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Notes and links\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下载源保持在CurseForge或Modrinth生态系统内，你可以自由在任何整合包中使用此整合包。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他任何事项，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
